      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This change is long overdue. The pending change will break many worlds that depend on `VRCPlayerApi.isInstanceOwner` for distinguishing when an instance is public. For example when a world exposes settings only available to private instances, keeping state of public instances known and consistent. Having to join every instance just to find out what state it's in is going to be a pretty bad user experience.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/udon/p/request-instance-type-nodes\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/udon/p/get-instance-type\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/udon-interaction-with-groups\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/udon/p/give-udon-u-access-to-instance-information-group-information",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-11-06T07:29:37.671Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I saw in the Dev Update that the person who creates a Public instance will become its moderator. However, I suspect this means that checking whether the instance owner is null to determine if an instance is Public will no longer work.\n\nI believe there are some situations where the distinction between Public and Private instances matters, so ideally, I'd like to see a Udon API that allows us to retrieve the instance's visibility type (Public, Friends+, Invite, etc.).\n\n(Actually, why isn't such an API available already?)\n\nja:\n\nPublicインスタンスを作成した人がモデレーターとなるというDev updateを見ましたが、これによっておそらく「インスタンスオーナーがnullならPublicである」という判定が効かなくなると思います。\n\nPublic/Privateインスタンスの別が意味を持つことは往々にしてあると認識しているので、ワールドの可視性（Public/Friends+/Invite etc.）が取得できるUdon APIがあると理想的だと思います（逆に今は何故ないのでしょうか？）。",
